      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Scene from pictures\n\n1. On SceneRef Scene press ＋ picture and add the main view: the camera. The result keeps its angle, framing and furniture.\n2. Optional: add the same place from other angles (role 'other angle'). The model gets them as extra references.\n3. Or wire Load Image nodes into main_view / other_angles, or pick a .scene file made with SceneRef Scene Maker.\n4. In the Studio add the cast, write the action (who is where: there are no mannequins), press ✎ Write the picture prompt, then Run."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "Scene from pictures\n\n1. On SceneRef Scene press ＋ picture and add the main view: the camera. The result keeps its angle, framing and furniture.\n2. Optional: add the same place from other angles (role 'other angle'). The model gets them as extra references.\n3. Or wire Load Image nodes into main_view / other_angles, or pick a .scene file made with SceneRef Scene Maker.\n4. In the Studio add the cast, write the action (who is where: there are no mannequins), press ✎ Write the picture prompt, then Run."
